% A5-MAKE2: IN T1, CHECK WHAT LAYER 1 LEFT, ADD LAYER 2 AND IMAGE IT INTO T2.
% TYPED AT THE CONSOLE, SO THAT IMAGE DOES NOT SAVE A LOAD LEVEL (SEE C1).
'IMGUTIL.STO LOAD
DECIMAL
"IN T1   " MSG 7 SQ = V1 @ = S1 MSG CR
"NEW REVISION" MSG DATE @ REV0 @ NE = CR
HEX
PTRS
DECIMAL
'CUBE : DUP SQ * ;
77 'V2 VARIABLE
"HELLO FROM LAYER 2" S1 MOVE_STRING
5 V1 +!
DATE @ 'REV1 VARIABLE
"T2:" MSG CR
'T2.TMP IMAGE
HEX
IORB<<
HINFO SHOW
>
